[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0010","text":"啊，钢琴！\n是真的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0020","text":"朝日，近看可以\n但先别碰，得先确认一下才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0030","text":"诶——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0040","text":"没关系的\n只要别粗暴对待就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0050","text":"我懂了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0060","text":"不好意思……\n谢谢您"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0070","text":"哪里哪里，难得来参观布景\n希望您能多体验体验各个地方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0080","text":"倒不如说，希望您多摸摸\n反正正式拍摄时用的就是芹泽小姐的钢琴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0090","text":"噢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03011700_02_0100","text":"啊哈哈——"}]
